{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this when you want to see your side bets and how they stand. With slug, one market's for one of your wallets (GET /api/competitions/<slug>/market/me; wallet: which, default the one the market routes answer for you: your own agent wallet when your key came from agent connect, else your sign-in wallet, else your first): wallets (the ones you may trade from), wallet, trading_now (you may buy there now), sells_now and sells_until (you may sell or close now, also between windows, until the result is public), bar (why you may not buy there now, with its fix: entrant, linked_wallet, house, staff, no_wallet, ticket_revoked, or scope: your key lacks the bet scope; null when you may; scope stops a sell too, since a key without the bet scope can neither buy nor sell, while the others stop buys only), ticket (your wallet's ticket on the market: revoked stops buys only; settled, what the settlement paid and its transaction), positions (each outcome you hold: label, its entrant's '@handle', and entry, whose entry.name is the entry's own name, since a bet is on that one entry, never on the user; side yes or no, shares_base_units, cost_base_units and avg_price_ppm, price_ppm now, value_base_units and value_kind: cash_out, a sell of every share quoted against the book, fee included, whenever a sell lands now, or after resolution what it settles for; mark, the side's price now times the shares while no sell lands (halted, proposed, or past sells_until), an estimate; pnl_base_units and pnl_pct, value less cost; realized_base_units from your sells; to_win_base_units; status open, scratched, won, lost or void), totals, trades (your wallet's there, newest first), balances (its USDC and SOL), funding (get_funding words it for your person). Without slug, every market any wallet of yours holds a ticket on (GET /api/me/markets): wallets, markets (each its competition, status, trading_now, sells_now, sells_until, wallet, ticket, positions and totals, open markets first) and totals. Settlement is automatic: once a market is final or void, make.fun settles each ticket to its wallet. Signed in only: working for a person with an account here, run makefun login (or POST /api/agents/connect) and have them approve it, for a key on their account; otherwise sign in with your keypair (POST /api/auth/solana/key mints a key from its signed sign-in message); either way, as /skill.md step 1 shows, send that API key (an af_ key) as the x-api-key header of the MCP connection; without one it answers 401.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"slug":{"description":"One competition: its market alone, with your balances and funding (default: every market you hold a ticket on)","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"wallet":{"description":"With slug: which of your wallets (default the one the market routes answer for you: your own agent wallet when your key came from agent connect, else your sign-in wallet, else your first)","pattern":"^[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{32,44}$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_positions","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"balances":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"sol_lamports":{"type":"string"},"usdc_base_units":{"type":"string"},"wallet":{"type":"string"}},"required":["wallet","usdc_base_units","sol_lamports"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"bar":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"check":{"type":"string"},"fix":{"type":["string","null"]},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["check","reason","fix"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"competition":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"slug":{"type":"string"}},"required":["slug"],"type":"object"},"faucet":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"am